WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.652 --> 00:00:16.936
The of Black Rain and the mountain's spirit gathered weapons.

2
00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:20.337
Suddenly the demon stopped and stared at her.

3
00:00:21.177 --> 00:00:23.678
"Why are you helping me, Spirit?

4
00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:25.799
I didn't think you liked me."

5
00:00:25.819 --> 00:00:30.440
"I like you a lot," the spirit said.

6
00:00:31.724 --> 00:00:34.705
"But I took over your mountain," the demon said.

7
00:00:34.725 --> 00:00:41.828
"Yes," the spirit said, "but you take very good care of it.

8
00:00:42.289 --> 00:00:44.069
I appreciate that.

9
00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:50.672
Besides, the goddess is really powerful, so you'll need my help."

10
00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:55.794
"Bah!" The demon waved a hand.

11
00:00:55.814 --> 00:00:59.276
"I'm not worried about that goddess.

12
00:01:00.348 --> 00:01:03.531
She's not as powerful as Swift Wing said."

13
00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:10.917
disagree," the spirit said.

14
00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:16.041
"I heard that she can shoot fire from her eyes."

15
00:01:16.061 --> 00:01:20.905
"Everyone can do that," the demon said.

16
00:01:20.925 --> 00:01:30.315
"She can fly," the spirit added, "and she has super breath that can blow demons away.

17
00:01:31.776 --> 00:01:37.620
She has so much super strength, she could probably lift this entire mountain."

18
00:01:39.681 --> 00:01:42.163
A bead of sweat dripped down the side of the demon's head.

19
00:01:43.164 --> 00:01:45.405
He quickly wiped it away and puffed out his chest.

20
00:01:45.425 --> 00:01:51.189
"Well, I have my magic rain power, and nobody can stop that!"

21
00:01:54.111 --> 00:01:54.892
He tapped his chin.

22
00:01:55.604 --> 00:02:03.208
"I hope she can't freeze rain, but otherwise I'm not worried Light sparkled in the cave, and the

23
00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:05.449
mountain's spirit transformed into Rocket Girl.

24
00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:08.111
The demon's eyes went wide.

25
00:02:08.131 --> 00:02:14.014
"You!" "The mountain's spirit made me look like her!"

26
00:02:14.674 --> 00:02:15.335
Roxy grinned.

27
00:02:15.355 --> 00:02:19.237
"Grr!" The demon charged toward Roxy.

28
00:02:20.697 --> 00:02:25.020
Pow! Roxy knocked him down, and then she leaped up, ready to attack.

29
00:02:26.664 --> 00:02:30.326
A strong wind whipped through the cave, throwing Roxy into a wall.

30
00:02:31.606 --> 00:02:34.728
Rain swirled around the demon.

31
00:02:34.748 --> 00:02:37.209
Whoo-oo-oosh! Roxy blew her freeze breath.

32
00:02:38.389 --> 00:02:40.971
The rain froze, encasing the demon in ice.

33
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:44.532
He twisted and turned, struggling to break free.

34
00:02:46.413 --> 00:02:47.694
The mountain's spirit appeared.

35
00:02:47.714 --> 00:02:51.575
"You must be quick, Rocket Girl!"

36
00:02:51.916 --> 00:02:52.416
she cried.

37
00:02:53.408 --> 00:02:56.791
"The demon's rain won't stay frozen for long!"

38
00:02:57.991 --> 00:02:58.952
The spirit vanished.

39
00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:04.876
"So long, Demon," Roxy said, running down a long hallway toward a heavy door.

40
00:03:06.617 --> 00:03:10.240
Bam! She kicked the door down, and inside the room were the prisoners.

41
00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:14.803
"You're the Tang Monk, right?"

42
00:03:15.183 --> 00:03:16.865
Roxy asked as she untied the ropes.

43
00:03:16.885 --> 00:03:19.987
"Don't tell her anything, Master!"

44
00:03:20.387 --> 00:03:21.148
Wujing said.

45
00:03:21.928 --> 00:03:23.288
"She might be a demon!"

46
00:03:23.308 --> 00:03:28.370
"I'm not a demon," Roxy said, rolling her eyes.

47
00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.470
"I'm here to save you."

48
00:03:31.331 --> 00:03:34.411
She finished untying the monk and then worked on Wujing's ropes.

49
00:03:36.032 --> 00:03:37.812
The Tang Monk watched her carefully.

50
00:03:37.832 --> 00:03:41.273
"Yes," he said finally.

51
00:03:41.293 --> 00:03:45.974
"I'm the Tang Monk, and that is my companion, Sha Wujing."

52
00:03:47.775 --> 00:03:48.975
Soon Wujing was free.

53
00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:52.297
"It's nice to meet you," Roxy said.

54
00:03:52.317 --> 00:03:54.198
"I'm Rocket Girl.

55
00:03:54.498 --> 00:03:56.039
We have to go—quickly!"

56
00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.382
The three of them hurried out of the cave.

57
00:04:01.023 --> 00:04:03.725
They rushed down the side of the mountain, jumping over shrubs.

58
00:04:07.187 --> 00:04:10.830
A horse appeared alongside them and allowed the Tang Monk to hop on its back.

59
00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.251
"Is that your horse?"

60
00:04:13.672 --> 00:04:14.312
Roxy asked.

61
00:04:15.673 --> 00:04:16.754
The Tang Monk nodded.

62
00:04:16.774 --> 00:04:19.256
"He's another one of my companions."

63
00:04:22.812 --> 00:04:25.453
"It's actually a dragon," Wujing said.

64
00:04:25.473 --> 00:04:29.795
"This place is strange," Roxy said, shaking her head.

65
00:04:32.076 --> 00:04:35.558
Before long everyone was off the mountain, but then the sky rumbled.

66
00:04:37.198 --> 00:04:40.540
Everyone turned around to see dark, evil-looking clouds forming.

67
00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.481
Wind began to whip down the mountain's slope.

68
00:04:45.562 --> 00:04:46.402
Roxy gulped.

69
00:04:46.422 --> 00:04:49.644
"Uh-oh!"
